          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ad carceres, ad judices Laeti trahuntur Martyres, In vinculis, in carcere Deum fatentur jugiter.",
          "english": "Joyfully the martyrs are dragged to prison and before judges. In chains and in prison they confess God unceasingly.",
