        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Confessione supplices Vestra precamur, Martyres, Numen, quod ore credimus, Nostris feramus moribus.",
          "english": "Through your confession, O martyrs, we humbly pray that we may bear in our conduct the God whom we profess with our lips.",
